# Howlsquad Heavy (2/3; "Other Goblins you control have haste"; at the beginning of combat on your turn a 1/1 red Goblin token that must attack that combat; max speed -
# {T}: Add {R} for each Goblin you control). Turn 1: the Heavy comes down, has no haste itself, and the token it makes has haste and must attack (the empty attack is
# refused); its damage raises Bot1's speed to 2. Turn 2: Bot2 casts its own Goblin Assailant, which gets no haste from the Heavy. Turn 3: a second token must attack, the
# first is free to stay home, and below max speed (3 after the hit) the Heavy has no mana ability. Turn 5: a third token attacks, the speed reaches 4 and
# the Heavy taps for four red (itself and three tokens; Bot2's Goblin does not count).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Howlsquad Heavy
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Goblin Assailant
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Howlsquad Heavy.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Howlsquad Heavy.Keywords = (absent)
? Bot1.Speed = 1
! Bot1.Attack()
Bot1.Attack(Goblin Token > Bot2)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Token.Keywords = Haste
? Bot2.Life = 19
? Bot1.Speed = 2
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Goblin Assailant.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Goblin Assailant.Keywords = (absent)
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Attack()
Bot1.Attack(Goblin Token#2 > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 18
? Bot1.Speed = 3
! Bot1.Battlefield.Howlsquad Heavy.Activate(Ability: Add)
[T5 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Goblin Token#3 > Bot2)
Bot2.Block()
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Speed = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Howlsquad Heavy.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}{R}{R}

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}{R}{R}
